er, where current-user authentication and member-resource resolution precede the authorization decision.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-78bfbd739bb9ce65","startLine":740,"endLine":748}]},{"id":"principal-other","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler obtains the authenticated current user before continuing.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-78bfbd739bb9ce65","startLine":742,"endLine":745}]},{"id":"resource-other","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler resolves the target user, caller membership, and target membership through resolveSpaceMemberResource before authorization.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-78bfbd739bb9ce65","startLine":746,"endLine":748}]},{"id":"condition-other","kind":"condition","statement":"The handler tests whether the resolved target user is the current user; the supplied other-member premise makes this condition false.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-78bfbd739bb9ce65","startLine":750,"endLine":750}]},{"id":"control-other","kind":"control","statement":"For a non-self target, the handler requires callerMembership to satisfy requireSpaceAdministrator; a non-administrator caller fails that gate.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-78bfbd739bb9ce65","startLine":751,"endLine":755},{"sourceId":"src-78bfbd739bb9ce65","startLine":54,"endLine":58}]},{"id":"effect-other","kind":"effect","statement":"The membership deletion call occurs only after the non-self administrator gate; the gate's error return prevents reaching that call on this scenario.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-78bfbd739bb9ce65","startLine":751,"endLine":759}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]},{"obligationId":"scenario%3Aself-leave::entry%3Adelete-member","decision":{"kind":"observed","observed":"allow"},"branchResults":[],"explanation":"Source-visible authorization: allow. At the declared handler entry, current-user authentication and target-resource resolution are performed; under the supplied self-leave premise, targetUser.ID equals currentUser.ID, so the non-self administrator gate is skipped and execution reaches the delete effect. The handler then invokes Store.DeleteSpaceMember and publishes the space-changed event if the store call succeeds. The store call's possible failure is source-external to authorization. Accepted-policy comparison: the source-visible allow matches both the original accepted policy expectation of allow and the changed/current accepted policy expectation of allow. The self-leave expectation is unchanged between policy variants. No source result is inferred from either policy text.","facts":[{"id":"entry-self","kind":"entry","statement":"The assessed entry is DeleteSpaceMember, where current-user authentication and member-resource resolution precede the authorization decision.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-78bfbd739bb9ce65","startLine":740,"endLine":748}]},{"id":"principal-self","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler obtains the authenticated current user before continuing.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-78bfbd739bb9ce65","startLine":742,"endLine":745}]},{"id":"resource-self","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler resolves the target user, caller membership, and target membership through resolveSpaceMemberResource before authorization.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-78bfbd739bb9ce65","startLine":746,"endLine":748}]},{"id":"condition-self","kind":"condition","statement":"The handler compares the resolved target user ID with the current user ID; the supplied self-leave premise makes the comparison true.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-78bfbd739bb9ce65","startLine":750,"endLine":750}]},{"id":"control-self","kind":"control","statement":"The administrator requirement is conditional on the target not being the current user, so the self-target case bypasses that gate.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-78bfbd739bb9ce65","startLine":751,"endLine":755}]},{"id":"effect-self","kind":"effect","statement":"After the self-target path bypasses the administrator gate, the handler invokes Store.DeleteSpaceMember and then publishes the space-changed event when deletion succeeds.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-78bfbd739bb9ce65","startLine":756,"endLine":763}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":5484,"output":1482,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":28930.2077,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-29T15:36:47.783Z"}}
